# serializer version: 1
# name: test_the_rendered_feature_is_pinned_whole
  '''
  Feature: Cancelling an unshipped order
  
    The customer clicks Cancel on an order that has not shipped.
  
    @must @immediate
    Scenario: behavior:order-cancelled#obs-1
      # at component:orders
      When The customer clicks Cancel on an order that has not shipped.
      Then The order reads cancelled.
  
    @must_not
    Scenario: behavior:order-cancelled#obs-2
      # at resource:order-cache
      When The customer clicks Cancel on an order that has not shipped.
      Then No entry for the order remains in the cache.
  
    @should @eventual
    Scenario: behavior:order-cancelled#obs-3
      # at resource:order-stream
      When The customer clicks Cancel on an order that has not shipped.
      Then An OrderCancelled event carries the reason the customer gave.
  
  '''
# ---
